# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of platform or the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows
# runners (including GitHub Actions' windows-latest, which defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true) check out .rs fixtures with CRLF even though the
# git blob stores LF, which the formatter's own safety oracle correctly
# flags as a changed significant token (a comment's literal text includes
# its trailing \r) inside tests that exercise internal primitives directly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled binaries — never touch line endings.
bin/** binary
assets/*.png binary
